326
00:46:47.844 --> 00:46:49.553
Then you take it.

327
00:46:49.554 --> 00:46:52.640
<i>Hmm?</i>

328
00:46:52.641 --> 00:46:54.641
Mm.

329
00:46:59.147 --> 00:47:00.940
Yeah, it's good.

330
00:47:00.941 --> 00:47:02.441
