I'm pregnant.

415
01:06:39.285 --> 01:06:41.285
I'm sorry.

416
01:06:46.333 --> 01:06:48.333
I'm so sorry.

417
01:08:49.290 --> 01:08:51.249
And [INDISTINCT] load?

418
01:08:51.250 --> 01:08:55.712
It will be done by next week.

419
01:08:55.713 --> 01:08:57.005
