427
01:09:14.440 --> 01:09:17.317
No.

428
01:09:17.318 --> 01:09:19.902
What is it then?

429
01:09:19.903 --> 01:09:21.654
Nothing.

430
01:09:21.655 --> 01:09:24.240
I was just thinking.

431
01:09:24.241 --> 01:09:26.241
Yes?

432
01:09:30.748 --> 01:09:33.708
At the end of the game,

433
01:09:33.709 --> 01:09:37.709
