442
01:17:34.523 --> 01:17:36.023
Thank you, senpai.

443
01:17:36.024 --> 01:17:39.024
Tea?
Please.

444
01:17:43.865 --> 01:17:46.665
So, tell me, what happened?

445
01:17:49.287 --> 01:17:51.287
Excuse me.

446
01:18:38.962 --> 01:18:40.921
